"""
AAR-7 — Aarohi reference-pack re-issue builder (Creative Director, Aarohi_Instagram_company)

Produces, from the owner-supplied anchor sheets (byte-preserved, band-appended only):
  * AAROHI_REFERENCE_PACK_v2_CHARACTER_SHEET.png   — char sheet v2.0 + burned-in §7.1 disclosure band
  * AAROHI_REFERENCE_PACK_v2_FACE_BODY_SHEET.png   — face & body sheet + burned-in §7.1 disclosure band
  * AAROHI_WARDROBE_REFERENCE_v1.png               — §7.3 wardrobe/modesty reference (NEW)

Rules honoured:
  * Original sheet pixels are NEVER modified — the disclosure is appended as a new
    footer band, so no reference panel or label is covered. Verified by hashing the
    untouched top region against the source.
  * Badge typography/metrics copied from the delivered-asset badge convention
    (300x66 plate #1f1f1f at 1080 px canvas width, DejaVu Sans Bold, white).
  * No generative photo synthesis is attempted (no image model is reachable from this
    runtime). The wardrobe sheet is an explicit garment SPECIFICATION sheet, labelled
    as such, not a photographic reference.

Layout engine: every text block is wrapped and measured before placement, so nothing
is clipped or overlapped. Re-run the layout QA after any text edit.

Run:  python3 build_reference_pack.py
"""
import hashlib
import json
import os

